\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["∣a∣＋∣b∣","∣a∣＋∣c∣","∣a－c∣","∣b－c∣"],"a":0,"e":"(Ａ)∣a∣＋∣b∣＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r45.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r46.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r47.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(Ｂ)∣a∣＋∣c∣＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r48.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r49.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r50.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(Ｃ)∣a－c∣＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r51.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(Ｄ)∣b－c∣＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r52.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r53.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r54.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r55.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴∣a∣＋∣b∣最大，故選(Ａ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910168","s":"計算　2x<sup>2</sup>－3　除以　x＋1　後，得商式和餘式分別為何？〔109.會考〕","o":["商式為　2，餘式為－5","商式為　2x－5，餘式為　5","商式為　2x＋2，餘式為－1","商式為　2x－2，餘式為－1"],"a":3,"e":"<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image7.png\" width=\"111\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴商式為　2x－2，餘式為－1<br>故選(Ｄ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910169","s":"下列何者可表示成兩個質數的乘積？〔109.會考〕","o":["81","82","83","84"],"a":1,"e":"(Ａ)　81＝3<sup>4</sup><br>(Ｂ)　82＝2×41（2　和　41　都是質數）<br>(Ｃ)　83　是質數<br>(Ｄ)　84＝2<sup>2</sup>×3×7<br>故選(Ｂ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910170","s":"已知小薇住家的西方　100　公尺處為車站，住家的北方　200　公尺處為學校，且從學校往東方走　100　公尺，再往南方走　400　公尺可到達公園。若小薇將住家、車站、學校分別標示在坐標平面上的（2 , 0）、（0 , 0）、（2 , 4）三點，則公園應標示在此坐標平面上的哪一點？〔109.會考〕","o":["（4 , －4）","（4 , 12）","（0 , －4）","（0 , 12）"],"a":0,"e":"<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image8.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"188\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>由圖可知　1　個單位長為　50　公尺<br>∴公園的位置為（4 , －4）<br>故選(Ａ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910171","s":"若一元二次方程式　5（x－4）<sup>2</sup>＝125　的解為　a、b，且　a＞b，則　2a＋b　之值為何？〔109.會考〕","o":["－7","－1","11","17"],"a":3,"e":"5（x－4）<sup>2</sup>＝125，（x－4）<sup>2</sup>＝25<br>x－4＝±　5，x＝9　或　x＝－1<br>∵a＞b　∴a＝9，b＝－1<br>2a＋b＝2×9＋（－1）＝18＋（－1）＝17<br>故選(Ｄ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910172","s":"如圖的坐標平面上有　A、B、C、D　四點，其中恰有三點在函數　y＝px＋q　的圖形上，且　p、q　為兩數。根據圖中四點的位置，判斷下列哪一點不在函數　y＝px＋q　的圖形上？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image9.png\" width=\"121\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["A","B","C","D"],"a":1,"e":"函數　y＝px＋q　為線型函數，其圖形為一直線<br>由圖中四點的位置可知　A、C、D　三點皆在　y＝px＋q　這一直線上<br>∴B　點不在　y＝px＋q　的圖形上<br>故選(Ｂ)<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image10.png\" width=\"121\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["109年會考"],"d":"易","html":1},{"id":"05910173","s":"如圖表示平面上　A、B　兩點與直線　L　的位置關係，其中　B　點在　L　上。若有一動點　P　從　A　點開始移動，移動過程中與　B　點的距離保持不變，則下列關於　P　點移動路徑的敘述，何者正確？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image11.png\" width=\"125\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["在與直線　L　平行且通過　A　點的直線上","在與直線　L　垂直且通過　A　點的直線上","在以　B　點為圓心且通過　A　點的圓上","在以<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r61.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">為直徑的圓上"],"a":2,"e":"∵動點　P　從　A　點開始移動，且移動的過程中與　B　點的距離保持不變<br>∴此距離<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r62.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r63.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>P　點移動的軌跡即在以　B　點為圓心，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r64.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">長為半徑的圓上<br>故選(Ｃ)<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image12.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"165\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910174","s":"如圖為甲班　36　名學生參加投籃測驗的投進球數長條圖。判斷甲班學生中，有多少人的投進球數小於該班學生投進球數的中位數？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image13.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"179\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["10","14","17","18"],"a":1,"e":"∵36　是偶數，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r67.svg\" width=\"22\" alt=\"附圖\">＝18，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r68.svg\" width=\"22\" alt=\"附圖\">＋1＝19<br>∴中位數是由小到大取第　18　筆與第　19　筆資料的平均<br>又　2＋3＋5＋4＝14，2＋3＋5＋4＋6＝20<br>∵第　18　筆與第　19　筆資料均為　4　球<br>∴中位數＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r69.svg\" width=\"36\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4（球）<br>投進球數小於　4　球的人數＝2＋3＋5＋4＝14（人）<br>故選(Ｂ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910175","s":"如圖為朵朵披薩屋的公告。若一個夏威夷披薩調漲前的售價為　x　元，則會員購買一個夏威夷披薩的花費，公告前後相差多少元？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image14.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"168\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["0.05x","0.09x","0.14x","0.15x"],"a":2,"e":"公告前會員價：0.85x（元）<br>公告後會員價：x×（1＋10％）×0.9＝0.99x（元）<br>公告前後相差＝0.99x－0.85x＝0.14x（元）<br>故選(Ｃ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910176","s":"平行四邊形　ABCD　中，E　點在<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r71.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，P、Q　兩點在<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r72.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，其位置如圖所示。若<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r73.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">與<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r74.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">相交於　R　點，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r75.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">與<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r76.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">相交於　S　點，則下列三角形面積的大小關係，何者正確？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image15.png\" width=\"127\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["△PBE＞△QBE，△PRE＞△QSE","△PBE＜△QBE，△PRE＜△QSE","△PBE＝△QBE，△PRE＞△QSE","△PBE＝△QBE，△PRE＜△QSE"],"a":3,"e":"(１)∵<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r78.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r79.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，P、Q　在<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r80.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上<br>∴△PBE　面積＝△QBE　面積（同底等高）<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image16.png\" width=\"127\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(２)∵△PRE＝△PBE－△RBE，△QSE＝△QBE－△SBE<br>由△PBE＝△QBE，且△RBE＞△SBE<br>可知△PRE＜△QSE<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image17.png\" width=\"127\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image18.png\" width=\"127\" alt=\"附圖\"><br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image19.png\" width=\"127\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故選(Ｄ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910177","s":"中秋節時阿柚製作的廣式月餅、蛋黃酥、鳳梨酥的數量比為　2：1：3，其中只有製作廣式月餅和蛋黃酥時使用鹹蛋黃。若阿柚製作每個廣式月餅時使用　2　顆鹹蛋黃，製作每個蛋黃酥時使用　1　顆鹹蛋黃，且總共使用　120　顆鹹蛋黃，則他製作了幾個鳳梨酥？〔109.會考〕","o":["45","60","72","120"],"a":2,"e":"設廣式月餅　2x　個，蛋黃酥　x　個，鳳梨酥　3x　個<br>則　2x×2＋x＝120，x＝24<br>∴鳳梨酥有　3x＝3×24＝72（個）<br>故選(Ｃ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910178","s":"如圖，P　點為矩形　ABCD　兩對角線的交點，將　P　點分別以<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r85.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r86.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">為對稱軸畫出對稱點　Q、R，形成六邊形　QABRCD。若<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r87.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r88.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4，則六邊形　QABRCD　的周長為何？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image20.png\" width=\"125\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["12","4＋2<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r90.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">","4＋4<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r91.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">","4＋4<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r92.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":3,"e":"∵Q、R　分別是　P　點以<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r93.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r94.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">為對稱軸的對稱點<br>∴<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r95.svg\" class=\"blk\" width=\"267\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>六邊形　QABRCD　的周長<br>＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r96.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r97.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r98.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r99.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r100.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r101.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>＝（<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r102.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r103.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">）＋（<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r104.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r105.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">）＋（<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r106.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r107.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">）<br>＝2<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r108.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r109.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r110.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r111.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋2<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r112.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2（<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r113.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r114.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">）<br>＝2（2＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r115.svg\" width=\"61\" alt=\"附圖\">）＝2（2＋2<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r116.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">）＝4＋4<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r117.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故選(Ｄ)<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image21.png\" width=\"125\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910179","s":"如圖為小麗和小歐依序進入電梯時，電梯因超重而警示音響起的過程，且過程中沒有其他人進出。<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image22.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"302\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>已知當電梯乘載的重量超過　300　公斤時警示音會響起，且小麗、小歐的重量分別為　50　公斤、70　公斤。若小麗進入電梯前，電梯內已乘載的重量為　x　公斤，則所有滿足題意的　x　可用下列哪一個不等式表示？〔109.會考〕","o":["180＜x　≤　250","180＜x　≤　300","230＜x　≤　250","230＜x　≤　300"],"a":0,"e":"∵x＋50　≤　300　且　x＋50＋70＞300<br>∴x　≤　250，且　x＞180<br>即　180＜x　≤　250<br>故選(Ａ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910180","s":"圓上有　A、B、C、D　四點，其位置如圖所示，其中<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r120.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">與<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r121.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">相交於　E　點，且<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r122.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r123.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">。根據圖中標示的角度，判斷下列四條線段何者的長度最長？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image23.png\" width=\"129\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r125.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r126.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r127.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r128.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":1,"e":"(１)∵<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r129.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r130.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴∠A＝∠BCA＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r131.svg\" width=\"114\" alt=\"附圖\">＝47°<br>∠ACD＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r132.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">　AD＝∠ABD＝44°<br>∠D＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r133.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">　BC＝∠A＝47°<br>(２)在△CDE　中　∵∠D＞∠ECD<br>∴<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r134.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r135.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">（大角對大邊）<br>在△BCE　中　∵∠BCE＞∠CBE<br>∴<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r136.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r137.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">（大角對大邊）<br>在△ABE　中　∵∠A＞∠ABE<br>∴<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r138.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r139.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">（大角對大邊）<br>(３)在△ABE　與△CBE　中<br>∵<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r140.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r141.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r142.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r143.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">，∠ABE＞∠CBE<br>∴<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r144.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r145.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">（樞紐定理）<br>由(２)(３)得<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r146.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r147.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r148.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r149.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故選(Ｂ)<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image24.png\" width=\"129\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910181","s":"如圖的正三角形　ABC　與正方形　CDEF　中，B、C、D　三點共線，且<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r151.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝10，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r152.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝8。若有一動點　P　沿著<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r153.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">由　C　往　A　移動，則<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r154.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">的長度最小為多少？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image25.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["4","5","4<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r156.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">","5<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r157.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">"],"a":0,"e":"∠FCA＝180°－∠FCD－∠BCA＝180°－90°－60°＝30°<br>當<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r158.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r159.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">時，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r160.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">的長度最小<br>∴此時△CFP　為　30°－60°－90°的三角形<br>故<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r161.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r162.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2：1<br>8：<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r163.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2：1<br>∴<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r164.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝4<br>故選(Ａ)<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image26.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910182","s":"坐標平面上有一水平線　L　與二次函數　y＝a（x＋7）<sup>2</sup>－10　的圖形，其中　a　為一正數，且　L　與二次函數圖形相交於　A、C　兩點，與　y　軸相交於　B　點，其位置如圖所示。若<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r166.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r167.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5：1，則<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r168.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">的長度為何？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image27.png\" width=\"147\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["17","19","21","24"],"a":2,"e":"由　y＝a（x＋7）<sup>2</sup>－10　可知<br>此拋物線的對稱軸為　x＝－7<br>設　x＝－7　的圖形與直線　L　交於　D　點　∴<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r170.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝7<br>設<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r171.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5k，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r172.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝k，其中　k≠0<br>∴<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r173.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r174.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＋<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r175.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝5k＋k＝6k<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r176.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r177.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r178.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3k，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r179.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r180.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">－<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r181.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝3k－k＝2k<br>故　2k＝7，k＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r182.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">，因此<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r183.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝6k＝6×<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r184.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＝21<br>故選(Ｃ)<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image28.png\" width=\"147\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910183","s":"如圖，直線　L　將正九邊形　ABCDEFGHI　分割成兩個區域，且分別與<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r186.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r187.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">相交於　P　點、Q　點。若∠APQ　的外角為　75°，則∠PQE　的度數為何？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image29.png\" width=\"131\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["75","85","95","105"],"a":1,"e":"∠BPQ＝∠APQ　的外角＝75°<br>∵正九邊形的一個內角＝180°－<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r189.svg\" width=\"37\" alt=\"附圖\">＝180°－40°＝140°<br>∴∠B＝∠C＝∠D＝∠E＝140°<br>如圖<br>六邊形　PBCDEQ　的內角和＝（6－2）×180°＝720°<br>∠PQE＝720°－（∠B＋∠C＋∠D＋∠E＋∠BPQ）<br>＝720°－（4×140°＋75°）<br>＝720°－635°<br>＝85°<br>故選(Ｂ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910184","s":"已知有若干片相同的拼圖，其形狀如圖(一)所示，且拼圖依同方向排列時可緊密拼成一列，此時底部可與直線貼齊。當　4　片拼圖緊密拼成一列時長度為　23　公分，如圖(二)所示。當　10　片拼圖緊密拼成一列時長度為　56　公分，如圖(三)所示。求圖(一)中的拼圖長度為多少公分？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image30.png\" width=\"42\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>圖(一)<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image31.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"167\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>圖(二)<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image32.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"227\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>圖(三)","o":["5.5","5.6","5.75","6.5"],"a":3,"e":"假設圖(一)中的長度為　a　公分<br>每多一片長度增加　d　公分<br>由圖(二)、圖(三)可知<br>①式－○式得　6d＝33，d＝5.5　………②<br>○式代入○式得　a＋3×5.5＝23，a＝23－16.5＝6.5<br>故選(Ｄ)<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image33.png\" width=\"42\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>〔另解〕<br>假設圖(一)中的長度為（x＋y）公分<br>由圖(二)、圖(三)可知<br>①式－○式得　6x＝33，x＝5.5<br>代入①式得　55＋y＝56，y＝1<br>∴x＋y＝5.5＋1＝6.5<br>故選(Ｄ)<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image34.png\" width=\"42\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910185","s":"如圖為三角形紙片　ABC，其中　D　點和　E　點將<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r195.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">分成三等分，F　點為<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r196.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">中點。若小慕從<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r197.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">上的一點　P，沿著與直線　BC　平行的方向將紙片剪開後，剪下的小三角形紙片面積為△ABC　的<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r198.svg\" width=\"14\" alt=\"附圖\">，則下列關於　P　點位置的敘述，何者正確？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image35.png\" width=\"147\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["與　D　點重合","與　E　點重合","在<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r200.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">上，但不與　D　點也不與　F　點重合","在<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r201.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">上，但不與　F　點也不與　E　點重合"],"a":3,"e":"如圖，設△APQ　為小慕剪下的小三角形紙片，其中<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r202.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">//<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r203.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">，且△APQ　面積＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r204.svg\" width=\"14\" alt=\"附圖\">△ABC　面積<br>∵△APQ～△ABC（AA　相似性質）<br>∴<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r205.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><sup>2</sup>：<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r206.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><sup>2</sup>＝△APQ　面積：△ABC　面積＝1：3<br>故<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r207.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r208.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1：<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r209.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>又<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r210.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r211.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r212.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r213.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r214.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>所以<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r215.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r216.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1：3<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r217.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r218.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝1：2<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r219.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">：<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r220.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝2：3＝1：<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r221.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r222.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r223.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＜2<br>∴P　點在<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r224.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">上，但不與　F　點也不與　E　點重合<br>故選(Ｄ)<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image36.png\" width=\"111\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>〔另解〕<br>（<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r226.svg\" width=\"14\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r227.svg\" width=\"14\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>若從　D　點沿著平行<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r228.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">的方向剪開後<br>剪下的小三角形面積為△ABC　面積的<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r229.svg\" width=\"14\" alt=\"附圖\">倍（相似三角形）<br>同理，（<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r230.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r231.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">，（<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r232.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">）<sup>2</sup>＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r233.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>從　F　點沿著平行<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r234.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">的方向剪開後<br>剪下的小三角形面積為△ABC　面積的<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r235.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">倍（相似三角形）<br>從　E　點沿著平行<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r236.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">的方向剪開後<br>剪下的小三角形面積為△ABC　面積的<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r237.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">倍（相似三角形）<br>∵<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r238.svg\" width=\"14\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r239.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r240.svg\" width=\"14\" alt=\"附圖\">＜<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r241.svg\" width=\"16\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴P　點在<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r242.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">上，但不與　F　點也不與　E　點重合<br>故選(Ｄ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"難","html":1},{"id":"05910186","s":"如圖為有春蛋糕店的價目表，阿凱原本拿了　4　個蛋糕去結帳，結帳時發現該店正在舉辦優惠活動，優惠方式為每買　5　個蛋糕，其中　1　個價格最低的蛋糕免費，因此阿凱後來多買了　1　個黑櫻桃蛋糕。若阿凱原本的結帳金額為　x　元，後來的結帳金額為　y　元，則　x　與　y　的關係式不可能為下列何者？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image37.png\" class=\"blk\" width=\"260\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["y＝x","y＝x＋5","y＝x＋10","y＝x＋15"],"a":1,"e":"因為阿凱後來多買的是　55　元的黑櫻桃蛋糕<br>所以他買的　5　個蛋糕中，價格最低的可能是　40　元、45　元或　55　元的蛋糕<br>若免費的是　40　元的蛋糕，則　y＝x＋55－40，即　y＝x＋15<br>若免費的是　45　元的蛋糕，則　y＝x＋55－45，即　y＝x＋10<br>若免費的是　55　元的蛋糕，則　y＝x＋55－55，即　y＝x<br>故選(Ｂ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05910187","s":"如圖，銳角三角形　ABC　中，O　點為　<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r244.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　中點。甲、乙兩人想在　<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r245.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　上找一點　P，使得△ABP　的外心為　O，其作法分別如下：<br>(甲)作過　B　且與　<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r246.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　垂直的直線，交　<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r247.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　於　P　點，則　P　即為所求<br>(乙)以　O　為圓心，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r248.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">　長為半徑畫弧，交　<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r249.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　於　P　點，則　P　即為所求<br>對於甲、乙兩人的作法，下列判斷何者正確？〔109.會考〕<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image38.png\" width=\"131\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["兩人皆正確","兩人皆錯誤","甲正確，乙錯誤","甲錯誤，乙正確"],"a":0,"e":"(甲)作過　B　且與　<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r251.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　垂直的直線交　<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r252.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　於　P　點<br>∴△ABP　為直角三角形<br>又　O　點為斜邊　<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r253.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　中點<br>∴O　點為△ABP　的外心<br>因此，(甲)正確<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image39.png\" width=\"131\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>(乙)由　O　點是　<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r255.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　中點可知，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r256.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r257.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>又　P　點在以　O　點為圓心，<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r258.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">　長為半徑的弧上<br>∴<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r259.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r260.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>故<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r261.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r262.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_r263.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∴　O　點是△ABP　的外心<br>因此，(乙)正確<br><img src=\"img/1c053f_y109_image40.png\" width=\"130\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>∵(甲)、(乙)均正確，故選(Ａ)","k":["109年會考"],"d":"中","html":1}]